Weblab Internet gateway

Weblab's independently implemented gateway/lifecycle code is MIT licensed.
The complete container is an aggregation of separately licensed components.
Alpine runtime packages, including BusyBox, musl, Python, dnsmasq, iproute2,
iptables and their dependencies, retain their own licenses and notices.

The release image retains its exact APK inventory, applicable upstream license
texts, GPLv2 and Weblab's original source/build inputs under
/usr/share/weblab-internet/. No vendor image or license is included.

The matching binary and corresponding-source archives, image identity and
SHA-256 checksums are published together in the matching Weblab GitHub release:
https://github.com/weblab-network/weblab/releases
Select the version in org.opencontainers.image.version. The source archive
includes exact Alpine recipes/patches and checksum-verified upstream distfiles
for all runtime APKs, plus Weblab's helper source and build inputs.
Keep these source materials/notices available when redistributing this image.
The host kernel and Docker Engine are prerequisites, outside this image.
